translate italian izzy10_25a42b94:

    # gl "Hey Twig. Um... [pcname]. It's Izzy."
    gl "Ehi, Twig. Ehm... [pcname]. È Izzy."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:21
translate italian izzy10_326e0196:

    # "She sounds down, like she's been crying. I've never heard her like this before. I pull over into a parking lot so that I can talk to her."
    "Sembra giù di morale, come se avesse pianto. Non l’ho mai sentita così prima d’ora. Accosto in un parcheggio per poter parlare con lei."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:24
translate italian izzy10_eb10a115:

    # pc "Hey. Is everything okay?"
    pc "Ehi. Va tutto bene?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:26
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:27
translate italian izzy10_5ecafd77:

    # gl "No, it's not. I fucked up bad."
    gl "No, non va bene. Ho combinato un bel casino."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:29
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_3.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_3.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:30
translate italian izzy10_420c216a:

    # gl "Devon and I got picked up by the police a couple hours ago. They say they're charging me with possession and intent."
    gl "Devon e io siamo stati fermati dalla polizia un paio d’ore fa. Dicono che mi accuseranno di possesso e intento."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:32
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_4.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_4.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:33
translate italian izzy10_cdc43134:

    # gl "I don't know what I'm going to do, [pcname]. I'm in a lot of trouble here."
    gl "Non so cosa farò, [pcname]. Sono davvero nei guai."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:34
translate italian izzy10_4814cea8:

    # pc "Oh shit. I'm sorry, Izzy. What can I do?"
    pc "Oh merda. Mi dispiace, Izzy. Cosa posso fare?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:36
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_5.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_5.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:37
translate italian izzy10_35f5b561:

    # gl "My brothers are probably at home right now, wondering where I am. They need somebody there to watch them. Can you just go sit with them for a bit until my auntie gets there?"
    gl "Probabilmente i miei fratelli sono a casa in questo momento e si staranno chiedendo dove sono. Hanno bisogno di qualcuno lì che li tenga d’occhio. Potresti andare a stare un po’ con loro finché non arriva mia zia?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:38
translate italian izzy10_f6efa27a:

    # pc "Yeah, I can do that."
    pc "Sì, posso farlo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:40
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_5:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_6.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_6.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:41
translate italian izzy10_68440382:

    # gl "Thanks, Twig."
    gl "Grazie, Twig."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:43
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_6:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_7.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_7.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:44
translate italian izzy10_61b525e8:

    # gl "I don't know what's going to happen to me, but you've been a good friend to me."
    gl "Non so cosa mi succederà, ma sei stato un buon amico per me."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:46
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_7:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_8.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_8.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:47
translate italian izzy10_d03ec30f:

    # gl "Thanks for everything."
    gl "Grazie di tutto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:48
translate italian izzy10_6b6f3352:

    # pc "You're welcome, Izzy."
    pc "Non c’è di che, Izzy."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:50
translate italian izzy10_d41d8cd9_8:

    # voice 'voices/izzy_10_9.mp3'
    voice 'voices/izzy_10_9.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:51
translate italian izzy10_511de65f:

    # gl "I gotta go. Talk to you later, hopefully."
    gl "Devo andare. Ci sentiamo più tardi, spero."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:52
translate italian izzy10_c363031d:

    # pc "Okay. Bye, Izzy."
    pc "Ok. Ciao, Izzy."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:56
translate italian izzy10_d0995620:

    # "I pull back out onto the streets and start driving over towards Izzy's house."
    "Mi rimetto in strada e inizio a guidare verso casa di Izzy."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:57
translate italian izzy10_541c797d:

    # "Izzy in jail. Man, that sucks. I wonder if I'll ever even see her again?"
    "Izzy in prigione. Cavolo, che schifo. Mi chiedo se la rivedrò mai più?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:60
translate italian izzy10_0161d2d8:

    # "At her house, I find the door unlocked. I open it and walk inside."
    "A casa sua, trovo la porta aperta. La apro ed entro."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:61
translate italian izzy10_0d5bc151:

    # pc "Hello? Anybody home?"
    pc "Ehi? C’è qualcuno in casa?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:62
translate italian izzy10_735aa81f:

    # "I can hear the television playing in the living room."
    "Sento la televisione accesa in salotto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:65
translate italian izzy10_48d7389b:

    # "Then two boys who must be Izzy's little brothers rush out."
    "Poi due ragazzini, che devono essere i fratellini di Izzy, si precipitano fuori."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:66
translate italian izzy10_c3511125:

    # "Older Boy" "Who are you? You better get out of our house!"
    "Older Boy" "Chi sei? Faresti meglio ad andartene da casa nostra!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:67
translate italian izzy10_a66a8306:

    # pc "Woah, calm down. I'm one of Izzy's friends. She's going to be uh... late."
    pc "Ehi, calmatevi. Sono una delle amiche di Izzy. Lei... ehm... farà tardi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:68
translate italian izzy10_807e3ac4:

    # pc "Your auntie is supposed to be coming, but Izzy wanted me to come sit with you until she gets here."
    pc "Dovrebbe venire la vostra zia, ma Izzy voleva che venissi a stare con voi finché non arriva."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:71
translate italian izzy10_1d52908f:

    # "Younger Boy" "Izzy? Who's that?"
    "Younger Boy" "Izzy? Chi è?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:72
translate italian izzy10_ecf25c52:

    # "Older Boy" "That's sis, dummy. That's what her friends call her."
    "Older Boy" "È mia sorella, sciocchino. È così che la chiamano i suoi amici."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:73
translate italian izzy10_9e4c4b50:

    # "Younger Boy" "Oh yeah!"
    "Younger Boy" "Oh sì!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:74
translate italian izzy10_380c7fa4:

    # "Older Boy" "Okay, you can come sit and watch TV with us, but if you try anything, we'll bust you."
    "Older Boy" "Ok, puoi venire a sederti a guardare la TV con noi, ma se provi a fare qualche scherzo, ti becchiamo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:75
translate italian izzy10_94570d10:

    # pc "All right then."
    pc "Va bene allora."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:78
translate italian izzy10_be6441de:

    # "I go in and sit on the couch, while they sit on the floor in front of the coffee table, doing homework and watching cartoons on the television."
    "Entro e mi siedo sul divano, mentre loro stanno seduti sul pavimento davanti al tavolino da caffè, a fare i compiti e a guardare i cartoni animati in televisione."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:79
translate italian izzy10_98c4afdf:

    # "After sitting for a couple minutes in awkward silence, the older boy turns towards me."
    "Dopo essere rimasti seduti per un paio di minuti in un silenzio imbarazzante, il ragazzo più grande si gira verso di me."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:82
translate italian izzy10_b0063ead:

    # "Older Boy" "What's your name?"
    "Older Boy" "Come ti chiami?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:83
translate italian izzy10_784c18d8:

    # pc "[pcname]. What's yours?"
    pc "[pcname]. E tu?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:84
translate italian izzy10_ceb1abab:

    # "Older Boy" "I'm Paul. My brother is Stanley."
    "Older Boy" "Mi chiamo Paul. Mio fratello si chiama Stanley."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:85
translate italian izzy10_70696046:

    # pc "Nice to meet you both."
    pc "Piacere di conoscervi entrambi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:86
translate italian izzy10_3a7290ac:

    # "Paul" "So, are you one of her boyfriends?"
    "Paul" "Allora, sei uno dei suoi fidanzati?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:87
translate italian izzy10_2d34af9e:

    # "Paul" "Sis has lots of boyfriends, but she usually doesn't let us meet them."
    "Paul" "Mia sorella ha un sacco di fidanzati, ma di solito non ci permette di conoscerli."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:88
translate italian izzy10_fc1855ec:

    # pc "Yeah, I guess I am. We're friends."
    pc "Sì, immagino di sì. Siamo amici."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:89
translate italian izzy10_0b6b2f16:

    # "Stanley" "Where is she? Why isn't she at home?"
    "Stanley" "Dov’è? Perché non è a casa?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:92
translate italian izzy10_e562930a:

    # pc "Well, the police arrested her. She might be going to jail."
    pc "Beh, la polizia l’ha arrestata. Potrebbe finire in prigione."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:93
translate italian izzy10_9d4dc068:

    # "Paul" "Oh. Like mom."
    "Paul" "Oh. Come la mamma."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:94
translate italian izzy10_363102ed:

    # "Stanley" "So we'll never see her again?"
    "Stanley" "Quindi non la rivedremo mai più?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:95
translate italian izzy10_05948c06:

    # "Paul" "Right."
    "Paul" "Esatto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:96
translate italian izzy10_db875c8c:

    # pc "I wouldn't say that. We'll just have to wait to see what happens."
    pc "Non direi proprio così. Dobbiamo solo aspettare e vedere cosa succede."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:97
translate italian izzy10_f0cc05be:

    # "Paul" "Yeah, okay."
    "Paul" "Sì, va bene."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:98
translate italian izzy10_9054da2b:

    # "Stanley" "I don't want sis to go to jail."
    "Stanley" "Non voglio che la sorella finisca in prigione."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:100
translate italian izzy10_8c26bb19:

    # pc "She just got busy with something, but she'll be home soon."
    pc "Ha solo avuto da fare con qualcosa, ma tornerà a casa presto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:101
translate italian izzy10_aed5f95e:

    # "Paul" "Really? She's always here when we get off the bus. What'd she get busy with?"
    "Paul" "Davvero? È sempre qui quando scendiamo dall’autobus. Con cosa era impegnata?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:102
translate italian izzy10_0d6ab269:

    # pc "Just some stuff she had to do."
    pc "Solo alcune cose che doveva fare."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:103
translate italian izzy10_f0cc05be_1:

    # "Paul" "Yeah, okay."
    "Paul" "Sì, va bene."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:104
translate italian izzy10_5c971f07:

    # "We go back to awkward silence for a few more minutes."
    "Torniamo a un silenzio imbarazzante per qualche altro minuto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:107
translate italian izzy10_d9654c38:

    # "Stanley" "Do you know how to do your multiplication tables?"
    "Stanley" "Sai fare le tabelline?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:108
translate italian izzy10_c0dfc38d:

    # pc "Uh, yeah I do."
    pc "Ehm, sì, le so fare."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:109
translate italian izzy10_5a2c5982:

    # "Stanley" "Could you help me with my homework then? I don't understand this stuff."
    "Stanley" "Allora potresti aiutarmi con i compiti? Non capisco questa roba."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:110
translate italian izzy10_e85ea253:

    # pc "Sure, let me see what you have there."
    pc "Certo, fammi vedere cosa hai lì."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:113
translate italian izzy10_b17956ae:

    # "Stanley gets up and sits on the couch next to me, putting his worksheet and book on his lap to show me."
    "Stanley si alza e si siede sul divano accanto a me, mettendosi il foglio di esercizi e il libro sulle ginocchia per mostrarmeli."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:114
translate italian izzy10_b975883b:

    # "Stanley" "I know that 8 plus 6 is 14. But this says that 8 times 6 is 48. How the heck does that work?"
    "Stanley" "So che 8 più 6 fa 14. Ma qui c’è scritto che 8 per 6 fa 48. Ma come diavolo funziona?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:115
translate italian izzy10_329fcf1a:

    # pc "So you know how to do addition? 8 plus 8?"
    pc "Quindi sai fare l’addizione? 8 più 8?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:116
translate italian izzy10_04dda5a7:

    # "Stanley" "Yeah."
    "Stanley" "Sì."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:117
translate italian izzy10_1c11dbdd:

    # pc "Well think of multiplication like you're doing addition over and over again."
    pc "Beh, pensa alla moltiplicazione come se stessi facendo l’addizione più e più volte."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:118
translate italian izzy10_b949eaf3:

    # pc "Here, write 8 six times on your paper. Eight six times is eight times six."
    pc "Ecco, scrivi 8 sei volte sul tuo foglio. Otto sei volte è otto per sei."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:119
translate italian izzy10_b115a24b:

    # "Stanley" "Oh, I get it."
    "Stanley" "Oh, ho capito."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:120
translate italian izzy10_8b68d233:

    # pc "Then put a plus between each of those 8's and add them all together."
    pc "Poi metti un segno più tra ciascuno di quegli 8 e sommali tutti insieme."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:121
translate italian izzy10_e6a0ee82:

    # "He starts adding, writing the number above each of the eights on his page until he reaches the last one that is 48."
    "Comincia a sommare, scrivendo il numero sopra ciascuno degli otto sul foglio finché non arriva all’ultimo, che è 48."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:122
translate italian izzy10_7d468f4d:

    # "Stanley" "I get it! Wow, you should be a teacher."
    "Stanley" "Ho capito! Wow, dovresti fare l’insegnante."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:125
translate italian izzy10_d3d886b1:

    # "I hear the front door open and a woman's voice calls out."
    "Sento aprirsi la porta d’ingresso e una voce di donna che chiama."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:126
translate italian izzy10_e6d98dc8:

    # "Woman" "Boys? Y'all in here?"
    "Woman" "Ragazzi? Siete tutti qui dentro?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:129
translate italian izzy10_e3c838b3:

    # "The woman, who must be the boy's auntie, walks around the corner and both of them rush up to hug her."
    "La donna, che deve essere la zia del ragazzo, gira l’angolo ed entrambi le corrono incontro per abbracciarla."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:130
translate italian izzy10_ec0adf9c:

    # "Auntie" "Everything okay here?"
    "Auntie" "Va tutto bene qui?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:131
translate italian izzy10_5e4c7b42:

    # "Paul" "Yeah, we're all good."
    "Paul" "Sì, va tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:132
translate italian izzy10_60d1cbf2:

    # "Stanley" "[pcname] was teaching me how to do my times table."
    "Stanley" "[pcname] mi stava insegnando le tabelline."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:133
translate italian izzy10_ad65d7e3:

    # "Auntie" "That's nice of him."
    "Auntie" "Che gentile da parte sua."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:134
translate italian izzy10_31976fc3:

    # "Auntie" "You two go to your room and pack up some clothes. You're going to come stay at my house for a few days, okay?"
    "Auntie" "Voi due andate in camera vostra a preparare un po’ di vestiti. Verrete a stare a casa mia per qualche giorno, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:135
translate italian izzy10_32e2b2bb:

    # "Paul" "Is sis okay?"
    "Paul" "La sorella sta bene?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:136
translate italian izzy10_d6e45f9a:

    # "Auntie" "She's okay, but she's going to be gone for a bit."
    "Auntie" "Sta bene, ma starà via per un po’."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:137
translate italian izzy10_e67935e5:

    # "Stanley" "How long?"
    "Stanley" "Per quanto tempo?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:138
translate italian izzy10_1f41c1ac:

    # "Auntie" "I don't know yet honey. Go pack your bags, okay?"
    "Auntie" "Non lo so ancora, tesoro. Andate a fare le valigie, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:141
translate italian izzy10_3581e151:

    # "The two boys run off towards their rooms, and I stand up to talk to their auntie."
    "I due ragazzi corrono verso le loro camere e io mi alzo per parlare con la loro zia."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:142
translate italian izzy10_f78cee83:

    # "Auntie" "Thanks for coming over and sitting with them for a bit."
    "Auntie" "Grazie per essere venuta a stare un po’ con loro."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:143
translate italian izzy10_5301b871:

    # pc "Oh, no problem. They seem like good kids."
    pc "Oh, nessun problema. Sembrano dei bravi ragazzi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:144
translate italian izzy10_bd9c1d85:

    # "Auntie" "They are. I wish they didn't have to go through all this. First their mom, now their sister."
    "Auntie" "Lo sono. Vorrei che non dovessero passare tutto questo. Prima la loro mamma, ora la loro sorella."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:145
translate italian izzy10_8a42d1af:

    # pc "Is she going to be okay?"
    pc "Starà bene?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:146
translate italian izzy10_74736fd1:

    # "Auntie" "She had a lot of drugs on her when they arrested her and that other boy. She has a couple of priors as well. It doesn't look good."
    "Auntie" "Aveva un sacco di droga addosso quando hanno arrestato lei e quell’altro ragazzo. Ha anche un paio di precedenti. La situazione non sembra rosea."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:147
translate italian izzy10_139f3015:

    # "Auntie" "I've been trying to get her to drop the drugs for a long time."
    "Auntie" "È da molto tempo che cerco di convincerla a smettere con la droga."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:148
translate italian izzy10_5e1c08a1:

    # "Auntie" "But it's hard to take care of two kids with a minimum wage job. Isabel didn't ask for any of this either."
    "Auntie" "Ma è difficile prendersi cura di due bambini con un lavoro pagato al salario minimo. Neanche Isabel ha chiesto nulla di tutto questo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:149
translate italian izzy10_847af3a0:

    # "Auntie" "I don't know how {i}I'm{/i} even going to take care of these boys."
    "Auntie" "Non so nemmeno {i}come{/i} riuscirò a prendermi cura di questi ragazzi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:150
translate italian izzy10_45975e4c:

    # "Auntie" "But, I'll figure it out. Got no other choice."
    "Auntie" "Ma troverò una soluzione. Non ho altra scelta."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:151
translate italian izzy10_527206cb:

    # "Auntie" "Anyways, thanks again. I'll take it from here."
    "Auntie" "Comunque, grazie ancora. Da qui ci penso io."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:154
translate italian izzy10_47574532:

    # "She walks me towards the front door, but before I leave, Paul and Stanley come back out."
    "Mi accompagna verso la porta d’ingresso, ma prima che me ne vada, Paul e Stanley tornano fuori."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy10.rpy:155
translate italian izzy10_82761cf4:

